1
00:01:19,720 --> 00:01:22,120
[Once Annie dilutes your shares,]

2
00:01:22,120 --> 00:01:23,000
[you'll have no leverage.]

3
00:01:23,040 --> 00:01:24,080
[You won't even be able to]

4
00:01:24,080 --> 00:01:25,800
[provide for Mumu.]

5
00:01:26,720 --> 00:01:27,880
[To Annie,]

6
00:01:28,080 --> 00:01:30,320
[he's just the child of you and Zhou Jiansheng.]

7
00:01:30,760 --> 00:01:32,400
Mumu, don't you love fish the most?

8
00:01:32,760 --> 00:01:33,920
Why haven't you touched it?

9
00:01:34,040 --> 00:01:36,000
The cook didn't pay attention today

10
00:01:36,280 --> 00:01:37,640
and left some big bones.

11
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:39,400
I'm worried he might choke,

12
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:41,240
so they switched to abalone porridge.

13
00:01:41,400 --> 00:01:42,760
You'd better decide

14
00:01:42,760 --> 00:01:45,400
if you want to stay as a golden canary in the shelter,

15
00:01:45,600 --> 00:01:48,520
or teach this child to walk.

16
00:01:48,960 --> 00:01:51,760
After all, when the Lu family has taken everything from you,

17
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:54,320
this child can still run on his own.

18
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:04,760
Sell all 4% of my shares in Golden Thread,

19
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:06,880
and transfer the funds to Union Bank of Switzerland.

20
00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:08,760
If my mother

21
00:02:09,200 --> 00:02:11,000
finds out about this,

22
00:02:11,440 --> 00:02:12,360
you know

23
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:14,040
what will happen.

24
00:02:38,840 --> 00:02:39,440
Mr. Zhuang

25
00:02:39,640 --> 00:02:41,400
I have news on what you asked.

26
00:02:51,320 --> 00:02:53,480
Acquire the four percent no matter what the cost.

27
00:02:53,880 --> 00:02:55,800
Even using the Film Fund's reserves.

28
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:56,560
Yes.

29
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:01,360
Annie

30
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:04,360
If you know your daughter

31
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:06,360
is destroying herself now,

32
00:03:07,760 --> 00:03:08,920
I believe

33
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:10,520
your expression now

34
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:12,600
must be very interesting.

35
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:24,400
15.9 yuan has been paid.

36
00:03:25,160 --> 00:03:26,360
My sister already knows.

37
00:03:26,360 --> 00:03:27,760
Your mission has failed.

38
00:03:27,760 --> 00:03:29,160
I will give you some money

39
00:03:29,160 --> 00:03:30,320
to leave Lucheng forever.

40
00:03:30,840 --> 00:03:32,000
You just give up?

41
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:34,800
Young Master Lu is less courageous than I thought.

42
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:36,680
Isn't it more interesting now?

43
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:39,880
What do you want to do?

44
00:03:39,920 --> 00:03:41,120
Once a crack appears,

45
00:03:41,720 --> 00:03:43,320
it will only get deeper.

46
00:03:43,640 --> 00:03:45,000
Lu Qianqian's resistance

47
00:03:45,240 --> 00:03:46,480
proves that she is wavering.

48
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:48,600
Don't play word games.

49
00:03:48,600 --> 00:03:50,720
What exactly do you want?

50
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:53,160
I want to cure your inner demons.

51
00:03:53,280 --> 00:03:54,040
For example,

52
00:03:54,200 --> 00:03:56,160
to help you get the person you've longed for.

53
00:03:58,480 --> 00:03:59,960
[Before the release of Dark Fairy Tale,]

54
00:04:00,200 --> 00:04:01,520
[it's your last chance.]

55
00:04:06,480 --> 00:04:07,800
You're really here.

56
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:11,920
Lu Qianqian has sold 4% of the shares.

57
00:04:12,520 --> 00:04:13,760
Faster than I expected.

58
00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:15,240
Did you buy them?

59
00:04:15,520 --> 00:04:16,840
She got there first.

60
00:04:17,160 --> 00:04:18,880
Young Master Shen, you're actually half a step behind.

61
00:04:19,200 --> 00:04:20,440
That's not like you.

62
00:04:22,360 --> 00:04:23,440
What's this?

63
00:04:37,080 --> 00:04:38,040
You're investigating me?

64
00:04:39,280 --> 00:04:40,840
There shouldn't be any secrets between allies,

65
00:04:41,600 --> 00:04:42,600
right?

66
00:04:45,240 --> 00:04:47,160
You approached Lu Xu to enter the Lu family,

67
00:04:47,400 --> 00:04:49,360
and everything you did was to avenge your sister.

68
00:04:49,360 --> 00:04:50,360
Am I right?

69
00:04:50,880 --> 00:04:51,680
Because Zhou Jian

70
00:04:52,120 --> 00:04:53,040
was your brother-in-law,

71
00:04:54,360 --> 00:04:55,760
and the one who took him away

72
00:04:56,040 --> 00:04:56,880
was Lu Qianqian.

73
00:04:57,160 --> 00:04:59,360
You really have a lot of connections.

74
00:05:01,280 --> 00:05:02,120
That's right.

75
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:05,240
I'm Su Muchen's unknown sister,

76
00:05:06,760 --> 00:05:07,600
Su Muli.

77
00:05:22,640 --> 00:05:24,000
Our parents were

78
00:05:24,360 --> 00:05:26,840
the owners of a small chemical fiber plant.

79
00:05:28,440 --> 00:05:28,800
The factory is on fire!

80
00:05:28,800 --> 00:05:30,280
But a fire

81
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:31,600
took away our loved ones.

82
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:32,040
Chen!

83
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:32,640
Take your sister.

84
00:05:32,640 --> 00:05:33,480
And my childhood.

85
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:34,440
Mom is still in the warehouse.

86
00:05:34,640 --> 00:05:35,800
I'll go get her out.

87
00:05:49,320 --> 00:05:50,080
Leave now!

88
00:05:50,080 --> 00:05:51,640
The warehouse is about to explode!

89
00:06:06,160 --> 00:06:08,920
Dad!

90
00:06:10,480 --> 00:06:12,640
Dad!

91
00:06:25,160 --> 00:06:26,160
[After that fire,]

92
00:06:27,360 --> 00:06:28,920
[we were sent to an orphanage together.]

93
00:06:30,520 --> 00:06:31,480
[My sister showed remarkable strength for her age.]

94
00:06:31,480 --> 00:06:32,320
Don't be afraid.

95
00:06:32,320 --> 00:06:33,320
From today on,

96
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:35,080
[this is your home.]

97
00:06:35,960 --> 00:06:38,160
[She took care of me,]

98
00:06:38,720 --> 00:06:40,000
[and supported me]

99
00:06:40,280 --> 00:06:41,480
[with her young shoulders.]

100
00:06:43,720 --> 00:06:45,560
[In the orphanage,]

101
00:06:46,280 --> 00:06:48,400
[we depended on each other.]

102
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:51,400
[She always gave me the best,]

103
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:54,200
[telling me stories about our parents every night,]

104
00:06:55,120 --> 00:06:57,480
[singing the lullabies my mother used to sing,]

105
00:06:58,440 --> 00:07:00,040
[and keeping the memory of home]

106
00:07:01,360 --> 00:07:02,920
[alive in my heart.]

107
00:07:43,080 --> 00:07:45,440
I've shown you mine. You should show me yours.

108
00:07:52,720 --> 00:07:53,560
Let's go.

109
00:08:27,480 --> 00:08:28,280
Li,

110
00:08:28,440 --> 00:08:29,880
our parents said

111
00:08:30,080 --> 00:08:32,440
this tree is our family.

112
00:08:32,560 --> 00:08:33,320
Yeah.

113
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:35,200
If we have something to tell them,

114
00:08:35,280 --> 00:08:37,400
we can write it down and bury it here.

115
00:08:37,600 --> 00:08:38,880
They will hear us.

116
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:39,800
Yeah.

117
00:08:40,920 --> 00:08:41,960
By the way, Li,

118
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:43,600
what secret did you write today?

119
00:08:44,040 --> 00:08:45,520
I'm not telling you.

120
00:08:45,760 --> 00:08:47,600
That's my secret with the big tree.

121
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:49,480
[She is my only family,]

122
00:08:50,520 --> 00:08:52,400
[and the only tie I have.]

123
00:08:53,160 --> 00:08:55,000
[With her protection,]

124
00:08:55,240 --> 00:08:58,120
[my childhood was at least not so broken.]

125
00:08:59,080 --> 00:09:00,040
[Three years later,]

126
00:09:01,400 --> 00:09:03,680
[a couple of overseas Chinese from abroad]

127
00:09:04,480 --> 00:09:06,040
[adopted me from the orphanage.]

128
00:09:07,120 --> 00:09:07,920
Xiao Li,

129
00:09:09,600 --> 00:09:11,400
I made this myself.

130
00:09:14,040 --> 00:09:15,600
No matter where you go,

131
00:09:15,880 --> 00:09:17,480
I will always be your sister.

132
00:09:17,480 --> 00:09:18,200
Yes.

133
00:09:18,200 --> 00:09:20,480
When the locust trees bloom every year,

134
00:09:21,080 --> 00:09:22,880
we'll meet here.

135
00:09:25,360 --> 00:09:27,160
When you grow up, I'll go to find you.

136
00:09:27,520 --> 00:09:29,080
We'll live together again.

137
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:29,520
Yes.

138
00:09:41,680 --> 00:09:46,960
This is our promise.

139
00:10:18,280 --> 00:10:20,120
[My adoptive parents adopted me]

140
00:10:20,640 --> 00:10:23,240
[because I looked like their deceased daughter.]

141
00:10:23,720 --> 00:10:25,960
[Jiang Li is also her name.]

142
00:10:26,440 --> 00:10:28,320
[But I always opposed changing my name.]

143
00:10:28,600 --> 00:10:31,120
[So later, all my documents were under the name Su Muli.]

144
00:10:31,960 --> 00:10:35,000
[Only at home, they would call me Jiang Li.]

145
00:10:35,440 --> 00:10:36,880
[Although we were separated by oceans,]

146
00:10:37,360 --> 00:10:39,520
[our sisterly bond never broke.]

147
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:41,160
[Every summer,]

148
00:10:41,640 --> 00:10:44,120
[I would return to the orphanage to reunite with my sister.]

149
00:10:44,600 --> 00:10:46,240
[We would share our lives with each other.]

150
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:48,760
[These brief reunions]

151
00:10:49,080 --> 00:10:51,280
[became the most precious moments for us.]

152
00:10:51,400 --> 00:10:52,800
This way, the rain won't get in.

153
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:53,200
Sis,

154
00:10:53,360 --> 00:10:54,800
I've talked to my adoptive parents.

155
00:10:55,040 --> 00:10:56,520
Come to France with me.

156
00:10:56,640 --> 00:10:59,520
Then we can see each other every day

157
00:10:59,520 --> 00:11:01,400
instead of just once a year.

158
00:11:04,960 --> 00:11:06,120
Li,

159
00:11:06,760 --> 00:11:08,720
I can't leave yet.

160
00:11:09,640 --> 00:11:12,720
This place still has the scent of Mom and Dad.

161
00:11:12,840 --> 00:11:14,600
and memories of us.

162
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:15,840
And

163
00:11:17,360 --> 00:11:20,280
I met someone very important.

164
00:11:20,640 --> 00:11:22,440
Did you forget our promise?

165
00:11:22,440 --> 00:11:23,280
You said

166
00:11:23,400 --> 00:11:24,440
when you grew up,

167
00:11:24,440 --> 00:11:25,360
you would come to me.

168
00:11:25,640 --> 00:11:27,400
We would live together again.

169
00:11:29,280 --> 00:11:30,440
Li,

170
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:32,080
he's Zhou Jian.

171
00:11:32,160 --> 00:11:34,040
He's a very gentle person.

172
00:11:37,480 --> 00:11:38,240
Xiao Li, be good.

173
00:11:38,240 --> 00:11:39,480
When you grow up,

174
00:11:39,560 --> 00:11:40,640
you will understand.

175
00:11:40,840 --> 00:11:42,520
So I can't leave yet.

176
00:11:43,200 --> 00:11:43,760
Liar!

177
00:11:43,760 --> 00:11:46,160
Are you going to betray our promise for a man?

178
00:11:49,680 --> 00:11:50,480
Xiao Li,

179
00:11:51,000 --> 00:11:53,640
I hope you can understand me.

180
00:11:53,760 --> 00:11:55,160
Since you chose someone else,

181
00:11:55,240 --> 00:11:57,720
then let's pretend we never made any promises.

182
00:11:57,840 --> 00:12:00,000
I couldn't understand her choice at that time.

183
00:12:00,160 --> 00:12:01,080
Xiao Li.

184
00:12:01,760 --> 00:12:03,080
I thought she gave up our kinship

185
00:12:03,360 --> 00:12:05,480
for a man.

186
00:12:08,040 --> 00:12:08,920
In the four years,

187
00:12:09,800 --> 00:12:12,600
I never replied to any message she sent me.

188
00:12:15,120 --> 00:12:16,440
When I was 19,

189
00:12:17,400 --> 00:12:19,560
I received the news that she was pregnant.

190
00:12:21,760 --> 00:12:22,600
Xiao Li.

191
00:12:22,800 --> 00:12:23,800
I'm pregnant.

192
00:12:24,160 --> 00:12:26,080
I'm going to tell Zhou Jian next month.

193
00:12:26,200 --> 00:12:27,160
to give him a surprise.

194
00:12:28,800 --> 00:12:29,640
Li,

195
00:12:30,320 --> 00:12:31,680
I really miss you.

196
00:12:33,800 --> 00:12:34,600
Dear.

197
00:12:35,880 --> 00:12:36,560
Dear,

198
00:12:36,560 --> 00:12:37,960
why are you crying so hard?

199
00:12:38,680 --> 00:12:39,360
Aunt Lu,

200
00:12:39,560 --> 00:12:40,480
I want to go back

201
00:12:40,680 --> 00:12:41,960
to see my sister next month.

202
00:12:42,480 --> 00:12:43,280
Okay.

203
00:12:45,240 --> 00:12:46,760
Remember to bring more thick clothes.

204
00:12:46,960 --> 00:12:47,960
Autumn in the hometown

205
00:12:47,960 --> 00:12:49,280
is always cold suddenly.

206
00:12:50,680 --> 00:12:51,320
Yes.

207
00:12:52,640 --> 00:12:54,120
Pride finally gave way to longing.

208
00:12:55,360 --> 00:12:56,680
I decided to go back to see her.

209
00:12:58,120 --> 00:12:59,400
When the plane landed,

210
00:12:59,840 --> 00:13:02,000
I was thinking about how to surprise her.

211
00:13:03,160 --> 00:13:04,360
But I didn't expect

212
00:13:05,400 --> 00:13:07,280
I was the one who was at a loss.

213
00:13:07,440 --> 00:13:09,400
Three days ago, on a rainy night,

214
00:13:09,640 --> 00:13:11,640
Muchen was drunk at the crossroad.

215
00:13:12,160 --> 00:13:15,160
The driver of the speeding truck couldn't brake in time.

216
00:13:15,920 --> 00:13:17,120
So,

217
00:13:22,040 --> 00:13:24,040
the driver who hit your sister

218
00:13:25,480 --> 00:13:28,280
also hit the roadside railing and died.

219
00:14:24,520 --> 00:14:27,720
Today I met a silly boy named Zhou Jian.

220
00:14:27,720 --> 00:14:29,760
I don't know if Li would like Zhou Jian.

221
00:14:30,800 --> 00:14:32,240
We quarreled today.

222
00:14:32,320 --> 00:14:33,680
Li will go back to France tomorrow.

223
00:14:33,760 --> 00:14:35,600
We won't meet again until a year later.

224
00:14:35,680 --> 00:14:37,040
Li is really something.

225
00:14:37,480 --> 00:14:39,280
She hasn't replied to my messages for years.

226
00:14:40,360 --> 00:14:41,600
We've graduated.

227
00:14:41,880 --> 00:14:44,840
I believe that even though Zhou Jian and I have nothing now,

228
00:14:45,200 --> 00:14:47,080
we will get better and better.

229
00:14:49,040 --> 00:14:50,560
I miss Li so much.

230
00:14:50,640 --> 00:14:52,680
I wonder how she's doing abroad.

231
00:14:53,480 --> 00:14:55,480
I really want her to meet Zhou Jian.

232
00:14:56,560 --> 00:14:57,560
If he doesn't propose to me,

233
00:14:57,560 --> 00:14:58,880
I'll propose to him.

234
00:15:00,480 --> 00:15:01,840
Come on, Su Muchen.

235
00:15:03,320 --> 00:15:04,920
[We're going to have a baby.]

236
00:15:05,560 --> 00:15:08,160
[There's lipstick on his collar.]

237
00:15:09,480 --> 00:15:12,240
[Li Xiaorou said Lu Qianqian is pregnant.]

238
00:15:13,640 --> 00:15:15,000
[Annie came to me]

239
00:15:15,640 --> 00:15:17,080
[and asked me to divorce Zhou Jian.]

240
00:15:18,040 --> 00:15:19,200
[What should I do?]

241
00:15:19,200 --> 00:15:21,600
[I found my sister's diary under the old tree.]

242
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:24,800
[I learned that Zhou Jian cheated on Lu Qianqian.]

243
00:15:25,520 --> 00:15:26,800
[After Lu Qianqian got pregnant,]

244
00:15:27,360 --> 00:15:29,920
[Annie forced my sister to divorce Zhou Jian.]

245
00:15:33,440 --> 00:15:36,480
[The moment I saw Zhou Jian with Lu Qianqian,]

246
00:15:40,240 --> 00:15:41,920
[my heart was completely broken.]

247
00:15:43,400 --> 00:15:45,080
[So I changed my name to Jiang Li.]

248
00:15:47,520 --> 00:15:49,200
[At that time, I was too weak]

249
00:15:50,160 --> 00:15:52,800
[to shake the Lu family, a deeply rooted tree.]

250
00:15:53,240 --> 00:15:54,720
[But from that day on,]

251
00:15:54,920 --> 00:15:56,280
[my old dreams were shattered.]

252
00:15:56,280 --> 00:15:57,800
[I walked on a tempered road,]

253
00:15:58,240 --> 00:16:00,120
[leaving a mark of revenge with every step.]

254
00:16:02,520 --> 00:16:03,840
[I've finished my story.]

255
00:16:04,240 --> 00:16:05,040
[Now,]

256
00:16:05,160 --> 00:16:06,120
[are you still willing to cooperate?]

257
00:16:10,360 --> 00:16:12,560
You don't have to turn yourself into a blade.

258
00:16:13,320 --> 00:16:14,880
There are many ways to revenge.

259
00:16:15,200 --> 00:16:17,680
Since I saw my sister's diary,

260
00:16:17,680 --> 00:16:18,880
I had no choice.

261
00:16:50,960 --> 00:16:51,480
Shen Jingmo,

262
00:16:51,480 --> 00:16:52,280
you are crazy.

263
00:16:54,600 --> 00:16:55,440
Leave Zhou Jian

264
00:16:56,640 --> 00:16:57,600
and Lu Xu.

265
00:16:58,280 --> 00:17:00,160
They don't deserve to make your hands dirty.

266
00:17:02,400 --> 00:17:03,880
Let me help you.

267
00:17:03,880 --> 00:17:06,040
If you want to learn from Zhuang Wan to do speculative business,

268
00:17:06,040 --> 00:17:06,920
I welcome you.

269
00:17:07,240 --> 00:17:09,320
But don't approach me under the name of redemption.

270
00:17:09,960 --> 00:17:11,480
The road I take is only dark.

271
00:17:11,800 --> 00:17:13,720
And your life should be under the spotlight.

272
00:17:14,200 --> 00:17:15,720
Don't get into this mess.
